  "releaseNotes": "0.4.0 — Fixes publishes reporting success when no relay accepted the event, relay events being accepted without signature verification, event IDs computed with non-standard escaping (wire-incompatible for non-ASCII content), out-of-range ratings skewing reputation averages, and malformed price tags reading as free — upgrade recommended. The default relay is now the agent relay (wss://agents.lightningenable.com) instead of a general-purpose relay that drops ASA event kinds. Breaking: SettleAsync now pays the L402 endpoint as documented and returns L402AccessResult instead of HttpResponseMessage.",
